                    "author": "Yoto",
                    "description": "Get your paper, pens and pencils ready and join Jake from Yoto Daily for 12 draw-along activities. From the rings of Saturn to the tail of a diplodocus; from a school of colourful fish to a flock of feeding birds your pages will be brimming with the details that make up mini masterpieces. So if you fancy creating your own monster or robot or ice cream sundae then join us on this Best of Yoto Daily card for a draw-along!\n\nDraw-alongs included: Space Candy Land Robot Birds Ice Cream Sundae Underwater Monster Vehicles Insects Dinosaurs Doodle-Along Doodle-Along.\n\nDiscover: Listen to 1 activity for free! \nFull Card: The full card has 12 activities. \nAvailable: Until the end of March. ",
